<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 02:17:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>抢劫者袭击了 3,000 家法国企业。几个小时内，这批货物就在 Vinted 上成为了骚乱日期的热门话题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/france-riots-retail-theft-vinted-ecommerce-resale-stolen-goods/</link><description>二手市场 Vinted 表示：“自本周末以来，我们的团队已立即采取行动，识别并删除与抢劫有关的商品。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2300110357-e1792796885521.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:35:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/france-riots-retail-theft-vinted-ecommerce-resale-stolen-goods/</guid></item><item><title>星巴克中国投资4500万美元改善店内体验，告诉顾客先买东西再坐下</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/starbucks-china-ends-free-seating/</link><description>这一规则改变之际，星巴克中国斥资3亿元人民币用于人员配备和门店升级。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2301459774-e1792768504897.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/starbucks-china-ends-free-seating/</guid></item><item><title>80 亿美元的财政减免帮助 Meta 的税率降至 2%。现在它有一周的时间向参议员回答有关数据中心税收抵免的问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/meta-8-billion-treasury-break-obbba-tax-rate-bill-data-centers-credit-elizabeth-warren/</link><description>参议员们希望 Meta 解释为什么它声称拥有人工智能数据中心的研究信用。梅塔说这些设施需要真正的实验。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2296204406-e1792774215803.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:21:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/meta-8-billion-treasury-break-obbba-tax-rate-bill-data-centers-credit-elizabeth-warren/</guid></item><item><title>能源市场正在将伊朗战争视为一场“永远的冲突”，而石油生产商则保持供应流动并避免“相互确保毁灭”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/oil-prices-energy-markets-iran-war-forever-conflict-hormuz-persian-gulf-mutually-assured-destruction/</link><description>“反复的供应冲击正在推动贸易路线和能源走廊的持久重新配置，尾部风险仍然很高。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2293738554-e1792762477916.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:41:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/oil-prices-energy-markets-iran-war-forever-conflict-hormuz-persian-gulf-mutually-assured-destruction/</guid></item><item><title>Z世代的“蟑螂”政党就删除1.3亿选民姓名的问题向莫迪发起挑战</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/cockroach-janta-party-modi-pradhan-resignation/</link><description>由于 25 岁以下的印度毕业生中有 40% 失业，蟑螂党正在向选举委员会施压。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2301026825-e1792788882741.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:55:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/cockroach-janta-party-modi-pradhan-resignation/</guid></item><item><title>我们曾为对立的总统服务，但我们在如何解决数据中心混乱问题上达成了一致</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/data-center-mess-how-to-fix-bipartisan/</link><description>拜登的前环保署领导人和特朗普的前联邦能源监管委员会主席表示，他们在很多方面存在分歧，但并不是说现状让美国失望。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/michael-neil.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/data-center-mess-how-to-fix-bipartisan/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 模型如何暴露 70% 互联网网站的缺陷</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/openai-cyber-php2shell-openai-flaw-websites-hackers/</link><description>世界各地的政府和组织于 2026 年 10 月 21 日开始紧急修复运行其网站的软件中的漏洞。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297785641-e1792787657915.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:36:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/openai-cyber-php2shell-openai-flaw-websites-hackers/</guid></item><item><title>伊丽莎白·霍姆斯纪录片制作人内森·菲尔德最初是一名经纪人。他辞职是因为这“令人沮丧”，现在已经赚了数百万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/nathan-fielder-comedian-elizabeth-holmes-documentary-career-journey-lessons-you-can-see-everything/</link><description>《你可以看到一切》预计第二周票房将达到 2500 万美元。但其联合导演内森·菲尔德 (Nathan Fielder) 的出身相当卑微。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2293901272-e1792766867235.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:25:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/nathan-fielder-comedian-elizabeth-holmes-documentary-career-journey-lessons-you-can-see-everything/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 与 Claude Duet 一起加入 Meta 和 OpenAI 的个人人工智能助理竞赛</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/anthropic-joins-meta-and-openais-personal-ai-assistant-race-with-duet/</link><description>随着 Anthropic 竞相在用户的日常生活中占据一席之地，Claude Duet 为现有订阅者提供了一名私人助理。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2260944681-e1792774188251.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:51:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/anthropic-joins-meta-and-openais-personal-ai-assistant-race-with-duet/</guid></item><item><title>近一半的零售员工表示，他们在过去一年中受到顾客的虐待，超过五分之一的零售员工为了安全而逃班</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/nearly-half-of-retail-workers-say-they-were-abused-by-customers-in-the-past-year/</link><description>许多零售工人还表示，他们认为雇主对库存安全的重视程度高于对工人安全的重视。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1058730108-e1792785680712.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:06:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/23/nearly-half-of-retail-workers-say-they-were-abused-by-customers-in-the-past-year/</guid></item></channel></rss>